{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/ezgif.com-speed__1_.gif?t=1745676016\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/Are_you_ready_to_become_the_greatest_decorator_____1_.png?t=1745676016\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/ezgif.com-speed__3_.gif?t=1745676016\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/Everything_is_as_YOU_want_it_to_be!__1_.png?t=1745676016\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/Test4-ezgif.com-overlay__2_.gif?t=1745676016\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let your inner designer make it cozy or totally chaotic. Change wall and floor colors, remove or add windows. There's literally everything here to make you feel like in your childhood. Have fun to the fullest and remember that only you can decide how your room will look like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/Metaverse!!!__3_.png?t=1745676016\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/ezgif.com-animated-gif-maker__2_.gif?t=1745676016\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute and clear gameplay will give you the ability to put every item wherever you want (yes, you can have a bed in the center of the room too). But your own room is just the beginning, the whole universe needs your help. Chat with digital customers on the freelance exchange, create unique rooms for everyone, buy additional items with the money you earn and enjoy the role of a real designer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/Variety_of_decorations_WOOOOW__1_.png?t=1745676016\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/1.gif?t=1745676016\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful, the number of items will make your head spin. Furniture of different colors, shapes and sizes, posters, kitties, computers, lava lamps and even an aquarium! People say that Roomgaze content has only been explored for 5%... But that's not the end of it. Constant item updates and new unique packs are waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/ezgif.com-speed__7_.gif?t=1745676016\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643220?t=1745676016","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/47167d7fb9340c3c5d8aa53dec96506a8657988c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745676016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/df51091c55b33e1810ef671a0c7b877439de12f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745676016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/df51091c55b33e1810ef671a0c7b877439de12f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745676016","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=