elp. Chat with digital customers on the freelance exchange, create unique rooms for everyone, buy additional items with the money you earn and enjoy the role of a real designer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/Variety_of_decorations_WOOOOW__1_.png?t=1745676016\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/1.gif?t=1745676016\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful, the number of items will make your head spin. Furniture of different colors, shapes and sizes, posters, kitties, computers, lava lamps and even an aquarium! People say that Roomgaze content has only been explored for 5%... But that's not the end of it. Constant item updates and new unique packs are waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/ezgif.com-speed__7_.gif?t=1745676016\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["pixelcoven"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/3876733e58c9ce4b0428215b8635891db1c06ec6/header.jpg?t=1745676016","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131297,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131297/movie480.mp4?t=1745676014","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131297/movie_max.mp4?t=1745676014"},"name":"Teaser Trailer ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131297/4936d8aad732d199a06bb846890c632c4d2fcb5b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745676014","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131297/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745676014","max":"http://video.akamai.ste